    "body": "I think non-manual tests should be possible here. I can think of a few ideas:\r\n\r\n- Testing using getComputedStyle(). Some cool examples of this are https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/33917 or https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/30178 , but those are specifically for the UA stylesheet, not for native appearance, so maybe it's not as applicable. You might need to write something more custom.\r\n\r\n- Reftests. At least mismatch tests, testing that progress with vertical writing mode does not render the same as it does with horizontal writing mode.\r\n\r\nI agree that because of the clause you linked about native appearance, these tests would be `.optional.html` tests. But adding them would still be good.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
